{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/33657","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:39.886925+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Some improvements are coming in #33597 . But note that trying to decode that avals and shardings of an Exported depends on internal implementation details. For example, you may discover than `out_avals[0].sharding != out_shardings_jax(mesh)[0]`. There are details in the shardings about abstract meshes vs. concrete meshes, and about how the memory space is encoded. What you should count on, however, is that when you `.call` an Exported then it behaves like the exported function.","created_at":"2025-12-06T08:42:47Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/33657#issuecomment-3619759609","id":3619759609,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/33657","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc7XwSX5","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3619759609/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-12-06T08:42:47Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3619759609","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3890983?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gnecula","id":3890983,"login":"gnecula","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTA5ODM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gnecula/star